  moralityInfo:
  - '"Public order completely disintegrated. Authority was dissolved amidst widespread
    panic."'
  - '"Despair proved more lethal than disease. Trust broke down, and order collapsed
    into chaos."'
  - '"Morality shattered. The people lost all faith in your leadership."'
  populationInfo:
  - '"The population fell below sustainable thresholds. The settlement has been permanently
    abandoned."'
  - '"Footprints in the mud led away from the gates. No one was left to keep the
    fires burning."'
  - '"The town emptied. Fear and starvation drove your people into the wilderness."'
  sicknessInfo:
  - '"The contagion breached every quarantine. Fever consumed the last breath of
    the settlement."'
  - '"No remedies remained, and no prayers were answered. The village fell silent
    under the weight of the plague."'
  - '"Outbreak uncontrolled. The disease claimed every remaining soul."'
